      "urn": "urn:cts:copticLit:besa.thieving.monbba",
      "dialect": "sahidic"
    },
    {
      "coptic": "ⲛⲉⲛⲧⲟⲗⲏ ⲕⲥⲟⲟⲩⲛ ⲙⲙⲟⲟⲩ ϫⲉⲙⲡⲣϩⲱⲧⲃ ⲙⲡⲣⲣⲛⲟⲉⲓⲕ ⲙⲡⲣ**ϫⲓⲟⲩⲉ** ⲙⲡⲣⲣⲙⲛⲧⲣⲉ ⲛⲛⲟⲩϫ ⲙⲡⲣϥⲱϭⲉ ⲧⲙⲁⲉⲓⲉ ⲡⲉⲕⲉⲓⲱⲧ ⲛⲙⲧⲉⲕⲙⲁⲁⲩ .",
      "english": "You know the commandments: &apos;Do not murder,&apos; &apos;Do not commit adultery,&apos; &apos;Do not steal,&apos; &apos;Do not give false testimony,&apos; &apos;Do not defraud,&apos; &apos;Honor your father and mother.&apos;&apos;",
